<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Gets an object's name. The non-localized name is returned if it is set, otherwise the localized name will be returned.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>In Toolset v1.0.982.0 GetName() returns nothing for waypoints.
</p>
